## Commands

- `mise run install` — register the prek pre-commit and pre-push gates (idempotent)
- `mise run lock` — resolve dependencies and write `pylock.toml`
- `mise run sync` — install existing locks without resolving dependencies
- `mise run test` — fast feedback after a logical edit; accepts forwarded pytest arguments
- `mise run test:all` — complete-suite verification
- `mise run test:flaky` — two independent full-suite runs with different seeds
- `mise run quality` — lint + format-check + {{ type_checker }}
- `mise run format` — auto-fix

## Repo map

- `src/{{ project_slug }}/` — the package; `cli.py` is the entry point
- `tests/` — pytest suite
- `scripts/test_feedback.py` — shared environment and test-result boundary for mise and prek
- `docs/` — project documentation
- `backlog/` — task store (backlog-py; work is assigned here before it starts)

## Context loading (on demand)

- Normative requirements → `docs/SPEC.md` (when present)
- Task store → `{{ run_prefix }} backlog-py board`

